        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre historique d'entretien ne devrait pas rester ailleurs simplement parce que vous avez changé d'app. Importez-le : cela ne prend qu'une minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your records are still on this device. Please don't delete the app, because that would erase them. Check for an app update, make sure your device has free storage, and restart it. If this keeps happening, contact support with code %@." : {
